          "concept": "Topological Sort Template Pattern",
          "depth": "work through",
          "anticipates": "procedure-execution",
          "why": "Both Kahn's (queue + indegree) and DFS (post-order reverse) side-by-side with when-to-use cues. Directly copy-pasteable."
